{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1274555-using-xp-to-reward-other-forms-of-participation","id":1274555,"title":"Using XP to reward other forms of participation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-15T07:40:04-08:00","id":1274555,"title":"Using XP to reward other forms of participation","content":"I'm curious if anyone else gives out XP for reasons beyond work done just being a character at the table. I give out XP to whomever &quot;scribes&quot; and does the detailed recap of what happens at each session (they tend to be 4-5 hours) as well as to players who help me flesh out other groups that exist in the world or provide creative back story for NPCs. Does anyone else do that? If so, for what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T13:19:43-08:00","id":1274613,"title":"","content":"I give out XP to players for contributing to the mood and setting of the chronicle, usually in the form of short fiction about their characters, but even things like playlists will do. I tend to put a cap on how much a player can get though, because not everyone wants to contribute that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampi